  "goodToKnow": "Das Komitee is a committee: das Organisationskomitee, das Nobelkomitee, das Internationale Olympische Komitee. It's neuter and stressed on the last syllable: ko-mi-TAY. For parliamentary committees, German uses der Ausschuss instead: der Haushaltsausschuss. Other synonyms: das Gremium, die Kommission. The word came from French comité, itself from English committee. Plural: die Komitees."
